{
  "dom_id": "step-q212145",
  "name": "Question 9",
  "problem": "Find the missing values in the following truth table:\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,(B∧A)∨(B∨A)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-4}} |",
  "worked_solution": "First, we complete a truth table for the first part in parentheses, $B∧A.$ The statement $B∧A$ is true if both $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,B∧A\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nNext, we append the truth table for the second part in parentheses, $B∨A.$ The statement $B∨A$ is true if either $A$ is true, $B$ is true, or both $A$ and $B$ are true. \n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,B∧A\\,$ | $\\,B∨A\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nFinally, we look at the column $(B∧A)$ and the column $(B∨A)$ to complete the column $(B∧A)∨(B∨A).$ The statement $(B∧A)∨(B∨A)$ is true if either $(B∧A)$ is true, $(B∨A)$ is true, or both $(B∧A)$ and $(B∨A)$ are true.\n\nThe completed truth table is shown below:\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,B∧A\\,$ | $\\,B∨A\\,$ | $\\,(B∧A)∨(B∨A)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
